# atomic sandbox replay v1
# M6 isotopes (Dock > Selection): select H2's nucleus 0 and make it 2H. The mass changes, the
# surface does not (SetIsotope changes the mass only and books the kinetic energy); the run then
# plays on it.
view 1400 900
action smooth-motion false
action preset h2
wait idle
action tool select
t 100 cursor 0.1043005 0.0244677
t 110 button left down
t 170 button left up
expect selected 0
action isotope 0 2
wait idle
expect isotope 0 2
expect isotope 1 1
action play
wait steps 8
action pause
wait idle
expect isotope 0 2
expect paused true
expect no-error
